## Vendored copy (not the answer)

A second, byte-similar definition exists at [`vendor/upstream-operator/quota.go`](https://github.com/dshnayder-org/infra/blob/e7d5fda895e3a9b7de9354d49235088c8fa3e0cc/vendor/upstream-operator/quota.go) line `5`, in package `upstream`. Its own header says it is not the live code:

```go
// validateQuotaSpec is vendored from upstream-operator v0.14.2. Do not edit;
// this copy is not compiled into the controller.
func validateQuotaSpec(ctx context.Context, pool *Pool) error {
	return reconcile(ctx, pool, "vendored")
}
```

