| --- | --- | --- |
| `modules/controller/quota.go` | `5` | first-party |
| `vendor/upstream-operator/quota.go` | `5` | vendored |

## Call sites

There are none. A full-tree `git grep` for `validateQuotaSpec` on this revision returns exactly the four lines above — two comments and two definitions — and a case-insensitive search for `quotaspec` / `validateQuota` returns nothing further. The repo holds only four `.go` files in total (`quota.go` and `nodepool.go` under each of `modules/controller/` and `vendor/upstream-operator/`), so nothing on this branch invokes the function.
